            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The same unavailable error covers missing and unauthorized records. The tool returns only the needed title, not internal account data. Invalid proposals consume budget too, preventing an unlimited loop of rejected attempts. In a deployed app, persist the run budget where concurrent requests cannot reset it."
